        <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">📍 'Gokula', 1st Floor, Union Bank Building, Opp. Green Park Hotel, Near Tiger Circle, Manipal, Karnataka 576104</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">📞 <a href="tel:+919108599083">+91 9108599083</a></li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 12px;">✉️ <a href="mailto:info@nrsrandco.com">info@nrsrandco.com</a></li>
